## Related PR
- https://github.com/aws-amplify/amplify-category-api/pull/3013

## Description of changes
- Introduces `a.ai.dataTool` for conversation route tool definitions.
- Supports model generated list queries for tools.

## DX

### Current
```ts
ChatBot: a.conversation({
  aiModel: a.ai.model('Claude 3 Haiku'),
  systemPrompt: 'Hello, world!',
  tools: [
    { 
      query: a.ref('myToolQuery'), 
      description: 'does a thing' 
    },
    {
      query: a.ref('listMyModels'),
      description: 'does a different thing',
    },
  ],
})
```

### New
```ts
ChatBot: a.conversation({
  aiModel: a.ai.model('Claude 3 Haiku'),
  systemPrompt: 'Hello, world!',
  tools: [
    a.ai.dataTool({
      name: 'myCustomOperationToolQuery',
      description: 'does a thing',
      query: a.ref('myToolQuery'),
    }),
    a.ai.dataTool({
      name: 'myModelListQuery',
      description: 'does a different thing',
      model: a.ref('MyModel'),
      modelOperation: 'list',
    }),
  ],
})
```

